# Active calls match this machine's former dotter/local.toml selection.
# Unselected tools remain commented out below; uncomment to enable them.
# Dotter itself is retired. Its colorscheme/zk_path variables had no consumers
# in these symbolic mappings, so no template engine is needed.

# Plain zsh, sourced by scripts/setup/link.zsh.
# Add a call to extend deployment; comment it out to skip it.
# link_file links a file or whole directory. link_tree links each file below it.
# Targets are quoted so spaces and $HOME work normally.
# Removing a call does not remove previously installed links.

# Tracked under config/ but deliberately not linked (source-only):
#   beatportdl, compressor, git, homebrew, iterm, ollama, python, tag-media

